<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>预约清洁 - 洁家家政</title>
<style>
body{font-family:"Helvetica Neue",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; margin:0; color:#333; background:#f9f9f9;}
.container{max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}
header{background:#004d40; color:#fff; padding:15px 0; text-align:center;}
nav{background:#00695c; display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:30px;}
nav a{color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:500; padding:10px 0;}
nav a:hover{color:#ffeb3b;}
.hero{
background:#004d40;
color:#fff;
height:300px;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
}
.hero h1{font-size:2.5rem; margin:0;}
section{margin:40px 0; background:#fff; padding:20px; border-radius:5px; box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}
form{max-width:600px; margin:auto;}
label{display:block; margin-top:15px; font-weight:500;}
input, select{width:100%; padding:8px; margin-top:5px; border:1px solid #ccc; border-radius:4px;}
button{
margin-top:20px;
background:#ff9800;
color:#fff;
padding:12px 24px;
border:none;
border-radius:4px;
cursor:pointer;
font-size:1rem;
}
button:hover{background:#fb8c00;}
.error{color:#d32f2f; font-size:0.9rem; margin-top:5px;}
footer{
background:#212121;
color:#fff;
text-align:center;
padding:20px 0;
margin-top:40px;
}
footer a{color:#ffeb3b; text-decoration:none;}
footer a:hover{color:#fff;}
@media (max-width:768px){
nav{flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
section{padding:10px;}
form{max-width:90%;}
}
</style>
